![African dance class](/media/2021/07/BecAfro-02-scaled.jpg)

### African dance classes

West African dance and Afro pop classes and events happen weekly on the Sunshine Coast. Live drumming and first time students can grab a deal!

{% button label="Read More" href="/classes/" align="left" /%}
{% /column %}
{% column %}
![African drumming class](/media/2021/07/A08R0539-scaled.jpg)

### African Drumming Classes

West African drumming classes occur weekly on the Sunshine Coast. Open classes cater for all levels. Every ten weeks students perform at the local Drum, Dinner Dance event.

{% button label="Read More" href="/classes/" align="left" /%}
{% /column %}
{% /columns %}

### Would you like to experience our classes?

Every week we gather together and learn West African rhythms on Djembe and West African dance. No experience is necessary and we include videos to keep you moving throughout the week. Are you interested in finding out more about our weekly [drum and dance classes in Palmwood](/classes/)? You can join our online community [here](https://www.facebook.com/groups/559526972928094).

